msgid "`size` &lt;Integer&gt; The desired length of the new `Buffer`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/buffer-alloc-unsafe_readme.md:38
msgid ""
"Allocates a new *non-zero-filled* `Buffer` of `size` bytes. The `size` "
"must be less than or equal to the value of `buffer.kMaxLength` and "
"greater than or equal to zero. Otherwise, a `RangeError` is thrown."
msgstr ""

